{"summary":"BLUE WEDNESDAY is a narrative adventure about jazz, love, and failure.","description":"Enter the enchanting world of Blue Wednesday, an interactive game that takes you to the vibrant city of Evans. As jazz pianist Morris, you'll explore the city, interact with other characters, play amazing piano, and much more. Join in and have fun in this picturesque world!\n\nSee life through Morris's eyes and fall in love with failure, love and jazz.\n\n<b>Explore the city of Evans with music</b>\nStep into Morris' shoes and explore the city's vibrant streets through mini-games, cutscenes, and conversations with unique characters.\n\n<b>Discover rare albums and Collect sheet music</b>\nInteract with various spots around the city of Evans and encounter other characters to discover rare music albums. From tango to bossa nova, cool jazz to modern jazz, collect a wide range of albums and enrich your rhythm plays.\n\n<b>Meet the colorful cast</b>\nInteract with your neighbors, each with their own story. The choices you make shape the story and lead to collecting valuable items.\n\n<b>Rich mini-games</b>\nPlay delightful mini-games that appear at key moments and make your journey more exciting based on your choices.\n\n<b>If you like this game, please help us spread this lovely game!</b>\n\n* This application needs access to the following ONLY for managing save data and video ads. No personal information will be gathered using those access.\n• READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\n• WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE","esrbNotes":"Strong Language","pegiNotes":"Strong Language","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VTAqtDWKgBI?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/XHXnsVscEV649quj9j9PZAp4A9Nv8KLpw4Ubw5v7og1mQTGragZ7WBU7KKzOTeOd7jNPx1wgD435jkNTSS9K","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qGtiYahpYlpqdd2CZ6ZTf7jx6mxSnnd7uzx6cDqhniWHi-vo8x3tldCJ6cFFbiSYg57pSc_zlHUon6WSVrck","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pYJ1SQj1k-3